  "description": "We Are the Streets is the second studio album by hip-hop group the Lox. Originally scheduled for a January 11, 2000, release, the album was released on January 25, 2000, by Ruff Ryders Entertainment and Interscope Records. It is their second album and is mainly produced by Swizz Beatz. Its commercial success was driven primarily by the singles \"Wild Out,\" produced by Swizz Beatz; and \"Ryde or Die, Bitch\", produced by Timbaland.",
